// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// ║ VILLAGE INTERIORS (Phase 4b) — every village building painted in the
// ║ same soft, lit style as the towers: a back wall with its own shelves,
// ║ windows and décor, a themed floor, furniture as depth-sorted sprites,
// ║ warm lights, and the shopkeeper standing at their workplace.
// ║ buildInterior(type) returns a site-art map (07-site-art.js); the game's
// ║ BuildingScene draws it and the Design Lab shows it (Interiors tab).
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
